- Implement sys_gethostname: query kernel utsname nodename, fall back to petraos.
- sys_tcgetattr: keep ioctl TCGETS path, add canonical termios defaults on failure.
- sys_pselect: translate fd_set to pollfd and route through sysdep<Ppoll>;
  guarded against the RTLD build to avoid pulling in malloc.
